      "caption_extra": "Section EXPORT AND IMPORT TRADE. Lead-in: \"...the rapid development of Tsingtao as a maritime port in the brief space of 27 years and under the administration of three nations is apparent from the following figures:\" (United States currency)",
      "continued": false,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": null,
          "columns": [
            "Items",
            "1903",
            "1913",
            "1923"
          ],
          "rows": [
