      ],
      "footnotes": [
        "NOTE.—The above figures and those following refer only to the water trade of the port. They are in United States currency and were converted at the following equivalents for the haikwan tael: 1903, $0.64; 1913, $0.7415; 1923, $0.8231. In addition to the water-borne trade there is a large volume of trade over the Kiaochow-Tsinan Railway."
